==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]], this was an unimplemented [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that used [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]'s sprites as placeholders.
*This is the second Cat Unit to attack once then die, the first being [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]].
*Prior to [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]], Stone Cat was the second fastest Cat Unit in the game, only beaten by [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]].
*This Cat Unit is tied with [[Wafer Cat (Special Cat)|Wafer Cat]] and [[Hell Warden Emma (Uber Rare Cat)|Hell Commissioner Emma]] for the third highest base health of all units, only beaten by [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] and [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]].
*This Cat Unit is the second unit to reference [[Gamatoto Expedition|GAMATOTO]], the first being [[Masked Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Cat]].

